    "text": "1 days ago The leaves will be turning, the air will carry that first crisp bite of autumn, and the streets of downtown Greenup will once again pulse with the warm, familiar rhythm of community. For over sixty years, Old Fashion Days has been the heartbeat of this Ohio River town, and the beloved festival is officially set to return with a flourish from October 1–3, 2026. Read full article",
